    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "458004c2-2f2b-40bf-8fd7-cad968995e49",
      "key": "6ccd0491-c3cc-468f-9eff-4f95aa8699e5",
      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "b0e742bc-c409-4060-9706-40c48693b1e3",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBlue Badge guide in the Lake District\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach throughout\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "f4887a9e-09e3-4bca-a240-2a6bd26dcc93",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFour nights on half board basis at the 3* Newby Bridge Hotel at Newby Bridge. Set in landscaped grounds, facilities at the hotel include a restaurant, bar, and indoor swimming pool, mini gym and a steam room. All rooms are en suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "0028e629-ae0f-4c7b-b671-91cf2c61a27f",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETatton Park\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHolker Hall\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELakeside \u0026amp; Haverthwaite Steam Railway\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELake Windermere\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWordsworth\u2019s House\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ERavenglass \u0026amp; Eskdale Steam Railway\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUllswater\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKendal\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESizergh Castle\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMoseley Old Hall\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "6ea29173-0429-4ecc-a6cc-887954f804f4",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBrougham Castle - founded in the early 13th century as a formidable barrier against Scots invaders and a prestigious residence that welcomed Edward I in 1300\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHill Top House - home of Beatrix Potter with many original watercolour paintings by the author\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELevens Hall - an Elizabethan mansion built around a 13th century pele tower with fine panelling, plasterwork and period furniture, and the world famous topiary gardens laid out by Guillaume Beaumont in 1694 and largely unchanged to this day\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Here are some more suggested places of interest you might like to include:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "eade6db4-5d87-4570-a309-15f6129ab29a",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Tatton Park\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoard our private executive coach at your preferred pick up points \u2013 visit a carefully selected National Trust property en route such as Tatton Park in Cheshire, one of the great country estates \u2013 continue to the 3* Newby Bridge Hotel at Newby Bridge.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Holker Hall, Lakeside and Haverthwaite Steam Railway \u0026amp; Lake Windermere\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHolker Hall is home to Lord and Lady Cavendish whose stately home and beautiful gardens are framed by the Lakeland Hills \u2013 arrive at Lakeside \u0026amp; Haverthwaite Steam Railway taking us through the Levan Valley, one of the Lake District\u2019s most beautiful valleys \u2013 45 minute cruise on Lake Windermere from Bowness-on-Windermere affording us wonderful views of the Lake and its shores.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Wordsworth\u2019s House \u0026amp; Ravenglass and Eskdale Steam Railway\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMorning visit with our local Blue Badge guide to Wordsworth\u2018s House and Garden \u2013 Ravenglass and Eskdale Steam Railway passes through two of the Lakeland\u2019s most picturesque valleys on its seven mile journey to Dalegarth.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013Ullswater, Kendal \u0026amp; Sizergh Castle\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETrip to Keswick and a cruise on Ullswater (cruise ticket extra) sailing from Pooley Bridge down to Glenridding \u2013 time for lunch in Kendal, the southern gateway to the Lake District, which was granted its market charter in 1189 and built largely of grey stone earning it the nickname of \u0026#39;the auld grey town\u0026#39; \u2013 visit the National Trust\u2019s Sizergh Castle and Gardens, a medieval house extended in Elizabethan times and surrounded by beautiful grounds.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Moseley Old Hall\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEn route home we stop at another National Trust property such as 17th century Moseley Old Hall in Staffordshire, once a haven for Charles II.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Every one of our tours is exclusively for your group and your group alone so each one can be tailor made to suit the interests and profile of your members until you have a tour with an itinerary and at a price which matches the interests and profile of your members."
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember this itinerary is just our suggestion. "
          }
        }
      ]
    },
